Package: kismet
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: WiFi, Bluetooth, and RF protocol monitoring aggregation layer
 Kismet is a WiFi, Bluetooth, and software-defined-radio protocol monitor,
 sniffer, and intrusion-detection framework.
 .
 This SIGedge packaging builds Kismet from source against Ubuntu 24.04's
 own libwebsockets-dev, deliberately not from Kismet's own prebuilt
 packages -- those depend on libwebsockets17, unavailable on Noble
 (kismetwireless/kismet#574). Installs to /usr/local, matching this
 repo's raw-build convention for the same software.
